type: software
title: "timecoda: Compositional Data Analysis for Time-Use Behaviour Research"
abstract: "Tools for compositional data analysis (CoDA) of time-use behaviour, such as the 24-hour composition of sleep, sedentary behaviour, light physical activity and moderate-to-vigorous physical activity."
